1
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:46,544
=Born Again=

2
00:00:46,544 --> 00:00:49,547
=Episode 16=

3
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:56,920
Alright.

4
00:00:57,920 --> 00:00:58,920
That's enough.

5
00:01:00,120 --> 00:01:01,120
Let's go.

6
00:01:06,880 --> 00:01:08,000
Are you alright?

7
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Let me see.

8
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:11,040
No. I'm fine.

9
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:12,040
Don't move.

10
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:31,880
You can't win, yet you came.

11
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:43,120
Well, I couldn't just watch them
all gang up on you.

12
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:44,280
So you just took the beating?

13
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:49,360
Did I hurt you?

14
00:01:49,600 --> 00:01:50,600
I'm good.

15
00:01:52,880 --> 00:01:53,880
Done.

16
00:02:01,160 --> 00:02:02,160
Thanks.

17
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:04,720
Is your face okay?

18
00:02:06,720 --> 00:02:07,720
It's nothing.

19
00:02:08,480 --> 00:02:09,480
I should be thanking you.

20
00:02:10,160 --> 00:02:11,800
You took that beating because of me.

21
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:14,960
You said you are my boyfriend.

22
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:17,960
I... I just said that to...

23
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:19,880
It's okay. I know.

24
00:02:22,600 --> 00:02:24,360
Didn't expect you
to be so sharp back then.

25
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:30,960
How about I walk you home?

26
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:34,480
I'll walk you home.

27
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:48,960
Xiaotang, what happened to your face?

28
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:51,800
Nothing.

29
00:02:58,320 --> 00:02:59,640
Get up, now.

30
00:03:00,200 --> 00:03:02,760
Well, if it isn't
our class hero and beauty.

31
00:03:03,880 --> 00:03:06,200
What? One night apart,

32
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:07,920
and your faces are all beat up?

33
00:03:08,480 --> 00:03:10,280
Did you do something bad last night

34
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:11,840
and get cursed?

35
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:14,640
I bet they scratched each other.

36
00:03:17,440 --> 00:03:18,440
Ye Shen,

37
00:03:18,920 --> 00:03:22,800
felt good getting punched for someone
in that alley last night?

38
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:24,080
Of course.

39
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,520
And you.

40
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:33,800
Gu Xiaotang,
if it weren't for Ms. Lei last night,

41
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:34,800
you'd be in for it.

42
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:37,680
From now on, behave yourself.

43
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:40,000
Lin Wei, are you done?

44
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:41,320
Is bullying fun for you?

45
00:03:47,160 --> 00:03:48,160
(Xia Na?)

46
00:03:50,720 --> 00:03:53,120
(Look how desperately
you claw your way up,)

47
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:54,760
(it's truly disgusting.)

48
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:59,120
Xia Na, this is none of your business.

49
00:04:00,320 --> 00:04:02,240
You treat Gu Xiaotang as a good friend,

50
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:06,320
but she's got a boyfriend now.

51
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:09,440
She doesn't have room for you anymore.

52
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:14,080
Gu Xiaotang,
if it weren't for Ms. Lei last night,

53
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:15,520
you'd be in for it.

54
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:17,760
From now on, behave yourself.

55
00:04:18,280 --> 00:04:22,000
Should I hand this recording
of the time, place, people involved,

56
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,640
and the bullying over

57
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:25,280
to the homeroom teacher?

58
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:30,480
Let's go.

59
00:04:36,280 --> 00:04:37,280
Xiaotang,

60
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:38,280
are you okay?

61
00:04:41,520 --> 00:04:43,520
Xiaotang, what's wrong?

62
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:44,800
It's me, Xia Na.

63
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:48,880
(Yeah, at this time,
Xia Na hasn't turned bad yet.)

64
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:50,920
(She's still my best friend.)

65
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:52,560
(But something feels off.)

66
00:04:58,200 --> 00:04:59,200
I'm fine.

67
00:05:00,080 --> 00:05:01,080
I'll go to the restroom.

68
00:05:17,200 --> 00:05:18,840
(She's being genuinely nice to me now.)

69
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,360
(I know.)

70
00:05:20,760 --> 00:05:22,880
(But I just can't.)

71
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:26,120
(I can't just pretend nothing happened.)

72
00:05:38,440 --> 00:05:40,120
Xiaotang, here.

73
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:42,720
Take it.

74
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:45,960
If you need this recording,

75
00:05:45,960 --> 00:05:47,280
take it to the teacher anytime.

76
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:50,360
Lin Wei went too far.

77
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:51,960
We can't just let this slide.

78
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:55,760
Thank you.

79
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,040
Is there anything else?

80
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:04,840
No, that's all.

81
00:06:06,640 --> 00:06:07,640
Then I'll

82
00:06:09,280 --> 00:06:10,280
get going now.

83
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:33,880
Gu Xiaotang,
if it weren't for Ms. Lei last night,

84
00:06:33,880 --> 00:06:35,320
you'd be in for it.

85
00:06:35,320 --> 00:06:37,560
From now on, behave yourself.

86
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:42,720
Honey, what's going on?

87
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:44,520
- Did someone bully you?
- No, Mom.

88
00:06:44,520 --> 00:06:46,040
Did Lin Wei bully you again?

89
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:47,880
- No.
- No?

90
00:06:48,480 --> 00:06:49,480
What did you listen to?

91
00:06:50,200 --> 00:06:51,240
Show it to me.

92
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:52,880
- No, Mom.
- Give it to me.

93
00:06:53,160 --> 00:06:55,280
Mom, give it back.

94
00:06:57,320 --> 00:06:59,240
What is this? Let me see.

95
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:00,800
- Give it back.
- It's proof Lin Wei bullied Xiaotang.

96
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:03,640
We need to see the teacher.

97
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:04,840
Lin Wei?

98
00:07:06,880 --> 00:07:10,680
The contractor's daughter?

99
00:07:16,280 --> 00:07:18,400
- Move! I haven't finished yet.
- Mom.

100
00:07:18,400 --> 00:07:19,400
Come here.

101
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:21,560
It's her, right?

102
00:07:23,760 --> 00:07:26,320
Su Dawei! Have you no shame?

103
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:29,720
This is proof
of someone bullying my daughter.

104
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:33,960
Are you going to use it to get money?

105
00:07:34,520 --> 00:07:35,520
Proof?

106
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:36,720
School?

107
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:37,800
Bah!

108
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:39,480
Can the school give you money?

109
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:40,800
You think I raise you for free?

110
00:07:41,160 --> 00:07:43,480
You got beaten up,
so you gotta make something back.

111
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:45,160
So what if you got beaten up?

112
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:47,960
If you don't use this evidence
to get me money,

113
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:49,560
are you saving it for your own funeral?

114
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:56,880
Su Dawei, have you lost your conscience?

115
00:07:59,280 --> 00:08:00,680
You chose this path yourself.

116
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:05,520
So what if I chose it?

117
00:08:07,520 --> 00:08:08,640
Listen carefully.

118
00:08:09,280 --> 00:08:11,120
Next time you get bullied,

119
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:12,320
be smarter.

120
00:08:12,640 --> 00:08:13,640
Record it clearer.

121
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:16,640
This is way faster
than you working for money.

122
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:22,200
Gu Xiaotang,
if it weren't for Ms. Lei last night,

123
00:08:22,200 --> 00:08:23,640
you'd be in for it.

124
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:25,240
From now on, behave yourself.

125
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:27,120
Mom, let me help you up.

126
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:30,840
You beast!

127
00:08:33,800 --> 00:08:36,320
Honey, I'm sorry.

128
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:39,200
I got you such a father.

129
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:41,360
I'm so sorry.

130
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:43,240
Mom, it's okay.

131
00:08:43,560 --> 00:08:46,640
I came back this time
to change all of this.

132
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:56,360
Ma'am, sorry to trouble you.

133
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:57,680
I will discipline her properly.

134
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:59,200
It's outrageous.

135
00:08:59,400 --> 00:09:00,400
Keep her in line.

136
00:09:00,640 --> 00:09:02,000
But don't hit her.

137
00:09:02,040 --> 00:09:03,040
Okay.

138
00:09:03,040 --> 00:09:04,040
Give her a good talking.

139
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:08,000
Ma'am, take care.

140
00:09:12,560 --> 00:09:13,960
I pay to send you to school,

141
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:15,280
so you can bully others?

142
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:16,840
You even got recorded!

143
00:09:17,280 --> 00:09:20,640
Even a scumbag like Su Dawei
came blackmail me with that recording.

144
00:09:21,040 --> 00:09:22,880
You've disgraced me completely.

145
00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:25,920
Dad, it was Gu Xiaotang...

146
00:09:25,920 --> 00:09:26,920
You dare argue?

147
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:29,240
If I hadn't paid to fix this
and bought the recording,

148
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:31,120
you'd have been expelled by now.

149
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:33,640
From today on,
all your cards are frozen.

150
00:09:33,640 --> 00:09:35,600
Forget about your allowance.

151
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:37,760
If you cause any more trouble outside,

152
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:39,280
I'll break your legs!

153
00:09:52,640 --> 00:09:53,640
One dot.

154
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:01,360
Red dragon.

155
00:10:06,800 --> 00:10:07,800
I won.

156
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:10,480
Ms. Lei, you're on a roll today.

157
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:11,720
Congratulations, Ms. Lei.

158
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:15,320
What are you waiting for? Pay up.

159
00:10:21,560 --> 00:10:22,560
Are you broke?

160
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:26,320
You still owe us from last time.

161
00:10:27,400 --> 00:10:28,400
No way.

162
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:30,280
I... I need to go to the bathroom.

163
00:10:30,280 --> 00:10:31,440
I'll go to the bathroom.

164
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:33,840
Watch him.

165
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,200
Ms. Lei.

166
00:10:42,160 --> 00:10:43,160
What now?

167
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:44,200
Ms. Lei,

168
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:45,360
you must help me get revenge.

169
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:46,840
It's Gu Xiaotang.

170
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:48,200
It's all Gu Xiaotang's fault.

171
00:10:48,560 --> 00:10:49,760
It's okay, girl.

172
00:10:50,520 --> 00:10:51,520
Her dad is in our hands.

173
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:53,160
He can't run.

174
00:10:53,160 --> 00:10:54,160
It's okay.

175
00:10:57,480 --> 00:10:58,480
Continue.

176
00:11:02,520 --> 00:11:03,520
Get him!

177
00:11:03,520 --> 00:11:04,520
Chase him!

178
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:07,720
Ms. Lei,

179
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:08,720
he pulls the same trick.

180
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:10,760
Don't let him get away this time.

181
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:15,440
Ms. Lei,

182
00:11:16,040 --> 00:11:17,160
you see?

183
00:11:17,680 --> 00:11:20,520
They don't respect you at all.

184
00:11:21,400 --> 00:11:23,560
Since they both don't know the rules,

185
00:11:24,760 --> 00:11:26,440
I'll teach them what the rules are.

186
00:11:27,640 --> 00:11:28,640
Ms. Lei,

187
00:11:29,920 --> 00:11:31,480
this is a distant relative of mine.

188
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:33,720
He's heard a lot about you,

189
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:34,720
and wants to follow you.

190
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:35,960
Could you mentor him?

191
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:37,440
What's your name?

192
00:11:38,760 --> 00:11:41,160
Ms. Lei, my name is Lu Qingyuan.

193
00:12:19,692 --> 00:12:23,048
♪The face deep in the heart♪

194
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:25,702
♪Suddenly clear and hazy♪

195
00:12:27,077 --> 00:12:30,777
♪Across time and space, eyes meet again♪

196
00:12:30,988 --> 00:12:33,428
♪Deeply trapped in the vortex♪

197
00:12:33,575 --> 00:12:35,947
♪Searching for familiar outlines♪

198
00:12:36,097 --> 00:12:38,854
♪Persistently guarding,
endlessly cycling♪

199
00:12:38,854 --> 00:12:41,175
♪Even for just a second♪

200
00:12:42,520 --> 00:12:45,983
♪If raindrops flow backward
into the sky♪

201
00:12:46,111 --> 00:12:47,960
♪And sunlight reverses♪

202
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:51,430
♪As the sun rises and sets,
we reunite with yesterday♪

203
00:12:51,786 --> 00:12:53,860
♪I'll build a dream with you♪

204
00:12:54,362 --> 00:12:57,771
♪Upon the ruins, spring breeze arrives♪

205
00:12:58,028 --> 00:13:03,240
♪Even if there's no end,
I won't regret the start♪

206
00:13:04,494 --> 00:13:07,059
♪Eternity like a day, rushing to you♪

207
00:13:07,101 --> 00:13:10,554
♪You don't need to recognize my eyes♪

208
00:13:11,131 --> 00:13:14,094
♪Following the tracks
of the days that were♪

209
00:13:14,839 --> 00:13:17,447
♪A day like a lifetime, rushing to you♪

210
00:13:17,447 --> 00:13:21,070
♪You don't need to remember my name♪

211
00:13:21,540 --> 00:13:25,596
♪I'll be the dawn you haven't seen♪
